# Source constraint for canfar-lab, consumed by `make lock-astroai-lab`.
#
# Unpinned on purpose. The lock pins transitive dependencies for lock-check.
# Image builds install that lock, then reinstall the latest canfar-lab from
# PyPI so the package tracks the current release at build time. Never edit
# the lockfile by hand.
#
# canfar-lab is a PyPI package.
canfar-lab
